    { "type": "text", "id": "final_caption", "x": 40, "y": 630, "width": 760, "height": 44,
      "text": "A caller holding RequestHandler calls handle() exactly the same way whether it's wrapped\nzero times or three -- adding a fourth layer never touches the caller's code.",
